Common setup for every reproducer in this directory.

  cmake 4.4.4 (pip/uv wheel "cmake"; any CMake >= 3.18 should do) must be in PATH:
    export PATH=<directory holding cmake>:$PATH
  WORK=<any scratch directory>   (was an absolute scratch path of the original audit machine)
  $WORK/src-base    = git archive of base-combined (v7.0.17 + the 142-commit combined series)
  $WORK/src-patched = git archive of base-combined + this group's 11 commits
  Pristine CMake build:  cmake -S $WORK/src-base -B $WORK/cm/base32 -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$WORK/cm/inst-base32 && make -C $WORK/cm/base32 -j8 && make -C $WORK/cm/base32 install
  Patched CMake build:   same with src-patched / cm/patched32 / inst-patched32
  (CI's own flags, ci/build_cmake.sh: -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON)
